# Production deploy

After changes that affect the sync server or the plugin it serves, deploy to https://e2e.fishmaple.cn without asking.

1. Build the server with `npm run build` in `server/`.
2. Build the plugin with `npm run build` in `plugin/`.
3. Run `python scripts/deploy.py` from the repo root. The script reads `server/.deploy.local.env`.
4. Confirm `https://e2e.fishmaple.cn/api/v1/health` succeeds.

The service port is 8791. Never print `DEPLOY_SSH_PASSWORD`. Do not commit `server/.deploy.local.env`.

Unless the user says not to publish, also commit the client change and push it to git@github.com:fishmaple/e2e-obsidian-sync-client.git `main`. Leave `server/`, `README.md`, and `docs/` out of that repository.
